{
  "endpoint": "http://127.0.0.1:1729",
  "enabled": true,

  "importMode": "off",
  "syncSessionOnStart": false,

  "recallLimit": 3,
  "recallTimeoutMs": 200,
  "recallLayerTimeoutMs": 2000,

  "identity": "off",
  "identityName": "",
  "identityTtlMs": 3600000,

  "token": "",
  "tokens": {},

  "watch": "",

  "_comment_scopes": [
    "分层记忆：读的时候按可信度分三层，写的时候也必须分层——",
    "否则这套分层只对历史数据成立，新对话立刻退化成一锅粥。",
    "",
    "  recallScopes  按优先级排列的检索回落链（'||' 连接，上层命中即停）",
    "  recordScope   一问一答的落点",
    "  factScope     compaction 摘要 —— 信息密度最高的提炼结论",
    "  thoughtScope  推理链落点（体积最大，排在回落链末尾）",
    "",
    "留空表示不分层，走服务端默认落点。"
  ],
  "recallScopes": [],
  "recallScopeLimit": 3,
  "recordScope": "",
  "factScope": "",
  "thoughtScope": "",

  "_comment_personas": [
    "人格 → 记忆落点的映射。一个身份一张凭证，每张凭证有自己的挂载表。",
    "personas 声明的 scope 必须落在对应凭证的挂载范围内，",
    "否则写入会被服务端拒绝（插件会在挂载身份时提前报出来）。",
    "",
    "示例：",
    "  \"personas\": {",
    "    \"laptop\": {",
    "      \"recordScope\": \"BlackEggAI/zero@main.record:record\",",
    "      \"factScope\": \"BlackEggAI/zero@main.record:fact\",",
    "      \"thoughtScope\": \"BlackEggAI/zero@main.record:thought\",",
    "      \"recallScopes\": [",
    "        \"BlackEggAI/zero@main.record:fact\",",
    "        \"BlackEggAI/zero@main.record:record\"",
    "      ]",
    "    }",
    "  }"
  ],
  "personas": {}
}
